    "title": "Fingerprint Live Animation",
    "description": "<b>Fingerprint Live Animation</b> app having large collection of  fingerprint animation and matching background to it on home and lock screen set as live wallpaper.\r\n\r\nApplication having lots of beautiful and attractive neon animations with matching 4K Wallpapers.\r\n\r\n\u2749 Very Easy and Simple steps to set Fingerprint Animation Live Wallpapers\r\n- From the list, Select any favorite animation which looks good.\r\n- As per device finger lock position,  Manage Fingerprint animation position up-down or scale up down.\r\n- Setup Customize wallpaper from Gallery or Capture Photos.\r\n- Save settings and continue to preview video.\r\n- Set Fingerprint Live Animation Video as live wallpaper on home and lock screen.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you",
